{"availability":"available","full":"dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator","name":"commit-message-generator","description":"Paste a git diff to get a Conventional Commit message, a PR description and an AI code review, plus a linter for the message itself.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T04:05:21Z","updated":"2026-10-10T03:50:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/commit-message-generator/","topics":["conventional-commits","developer-tools","git","github-pages","javascript"],"demo":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/commit-message-generator/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.400Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.400Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.400Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.400Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Paste a git diff to get a Conventional Commit message, a PR description and an AI code review, plus a linter for the message itself.","Commit Crafter parses unified diffs: added, deleted and renamed files, hunks, line numbers, binary files. It renders them as a collapsible diff viewer with per-file change bars. Local heuristics guess the commit type (docs, test, ci, build, style for whitespace-only changes, fix, refactor, perf, feat) and a scope from the common directory. The AI then writes the message in Conventional Commits, Gitmoji or plain style, drafts a PR description, and reviews the changed lines with file:line comments. A live linter checks the message against the usual rules."],"features":["Unified diff parser: new/deleted/renamed files, hunks, old/new line numbers, binary detection","Collapsible diff viewer with add/delete stats and change bars","Local commit-type + scope inference (whitespace-only → style, lockfiles → build, tests → test …)","AI commit messages in Conventional Commits / Gitmoji / plain style, with optional 'why' context","Live message linter: 72-col subject/body, imperative mood, conventional prefix, blank line, specificity"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8304d175d7291fcce70615fb274980f002e38ece6dc7bf40ac56af908dff59ab","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.504Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.504Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Paste a git diff to get a Conventional Commit message, a PR description and an AI code review, plus a linter for the message itself.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"index.html is the public home page, login.html handles accounts and app.html is the app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8304d175d7291fcce70615fb274980f002e38ece6dc7bf40ac56af908dff59ab","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.504Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T03:50:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/commit-message-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.504Z","hash":"8304d175d7291fcce70615fb274980f002e38ece6dc7bf40ac56af908dff59ab","originalBytes":5774,"storedBytes":5774,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["src","page","diff","tests","app","message","commit","git","lib","line","live","scope","settings","browser","build","changelog","code","conventional","description","every","key","linter","runs","style","type","accounts","added","body","changes","checks","commits","core.js","docs","files","functions","generated","heuristics","index.html","lines","linting","local","logic","new","plain","provider","review","styles","test","them","unified","unit","viewer","add","app.html","bash","binary","bo